YesStyle,"I like to shop on Yesstyle, cheap prices, good selection, buy most of my make up and skin care from there. But... their customer service is not amazing, I don't like to buy clothes from them because some of the sizing info is incorrect, like wildly incorrect, I emailed them about something I ordered being the wrong size and they ignored me! So don't expect the standard of customer service that you get with Amazon, for instance. They often advertise a ""discount"" but mark up the price temporarily to show a fake discount. Like it would say ""50% off"" but mark up the price by 50% so it's actually the usual price, to prompt you to buy... it's a trick, so watch out for their ""discounts"". On to the review of the app... it's not great. It keeps reverting to US dollars everytime I use the app and it won't save my preference as Canadian dollars. It also keeps crashing all the time. But, I will keep using Yesstyle because they have the best prices and selection by far. You just have to be wary of certain things.",2,Negative
